heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850254988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106078#issuecomment-2850254988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106078","id":2850254988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p43CM","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T08:23:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T08:23:03Z","body":"I dont have a D3D12  build to test. Can you test if this also happens with other Node3D gizmos that use point handles?\nE.g. `CollisionShape3D` with `BoxShape3D` or `NavigationObstacle3D` with `vertices`.\n\nThe reason is that as far is I know CSG has no branching for the different driver / rendering backends but the main Node3D Editor and gizmo has that CSG uses. In that case all those classes with point handles should be affected and this is not a CSG specific issue.\n\nAlso if only a few node classes are affected, e.g. the BoxShape is affected but not the NavigationObstacle3D, it is likely even more of a narrow issue with the e.g. sub gizmo BoxHelper.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850254988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869166022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106078#issuecomment-2869166022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106078","id":2869166022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rA__G","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-10T21:38:01Z","updated_at":"2025-05-10T21:38:01Z","body":"I did some tests using `CSGBox3D`, `CollisionShape3D` with a `BoxShape` and `Path3D` with some points, all of them don't show the move/resize handles with `d3d12` driver. Tested with latest master (19bb18716), 4.4 stable, 4.3 stable and 4.3 dev 3.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repo